#. copy/title
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop.js:42
msgctxt "tree:copy#/title"
msgid "Design a spell card. Fly it yourself."
msgstr "スペルカードを作って、飛んでみよう。"

#. copy/lead
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop.js:42
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"Choose a pattern, tune the rules, and try a test flight. Six reviewers check "
"exits, expression, visibility, stability, stimulation, and the noise "
"reaching the Fairy Choir."
msgstr "弾幕を選び、ルールを調整して試しに飛んでみましょう。六組の審査員が退路、表現、見やすさ、安定性、刺激、妖精合唱団に届く音まで確認します。"

