#. copy/answerAll
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop.js:42
msgctxt "tree:copy#/answerAll"
msgid ""
"Leave a position on all three questions. Silence preserves the draft; it is "
"not a defence."
msgstr "三問すべてに立場を残すこと。沈黙は下書きを残すが、答弁にはならない。"

#. copy/submitDefence
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop.js:42
